{"4905570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BONKER LADS", "steam_appid": 4905570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BONKER LADS is a first person, physics based ragdoll combat game where every fight is chaotic, unpredictable, and fast.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Punch, kick, or shoot</strong> your opponents to <strong>knock them off the arena</strong> and be the <strong>last one standing</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Manage your <strong>stamina</strong> carefull , every attack, kick, and movement consumes it, so timing your actions is just as important as landing your hits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The last player standing earns points, and the next round begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905570/extras/87e75f7874c5e5dac3021a0200ff6f3d.poster.avif?t=1784042948\" width=490 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905570/extras/87e75f7874c5e5dac3021a0200ff6f3d.webm?t=1784042948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905570/extras/87e75f7874c5e5dac3021a0200ff6f3d.mp4?t=1784042948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every movement is driven by physics</strong>, making each match completely unique and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Battles never play out the same. One moment you're dominating the arena, the next you're flying off the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Victory depends on both <strong>skill</strong> and  <strong>luck</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905570/extras/e189a04b1ca9873ed81c891ae2d9e94f.poster.avif?t=1784042948\" width=490 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905570/extras/e189a04b1ca9873ed81c891ae2d9e94f.webm?t=1784042948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905570/extras/e189a04b1ca9873ed81c891ae2d9e94f.mp4?t=1784042948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can <strong>interact</strong> with objects in the world , <strong>pick them</strong> , <strong>throw them</strong> , or simply use them as a <strong>blunt weapon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">For example <strong>you can pick a sword and throw them into your enemies</strong> , dealing them damage ,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">or just <strong>shoot at them with a fire arm</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905570/extras/711e205545bd2e409fda56184428f1a5.poster.avif?t=1784042948\" width=490 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905570/extras/711e205545bd2e409fda56184428f1a5.webm?t=1784042948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905570/extras/711e205545bd2e409fda56184428f1a5.mp4?t=1784042948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SINGLEPLAYER / MULTIPLAYER / CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Earn points</strong> every round, and the player with the highest score at the end wins the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight across a <strong>variety of maps</strong> filled with <strong>physics based interactive objects</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play <strong>solo</strong>, with <strong>friends</strong>, or <strong>team up against bots</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The number of players in a lobby is limited only by the server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905570/extras/afd6101b410792ffce16c93fcf47d868.poster.avif?t=1784042948\" width=490 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905570/extras/afd6101b410792ffce16c93fcf47d868.webm?t=1784042948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905570/extras/afd6101b410792ffce16c93fcf47d868.mp4?t=1784042948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BONKER LADS is a first person, 